QuestGuidance.Register("en",129,{
[4097]="7006567B\n1\tDeliver the materials to Gaath at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/5)\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/5)\030Collect Grimwood kindling\tMake your way into the wilds of the Ettenmoors and collect the materials needed to construct the external gate.\n",
[4098]="70065676\n1\tReturn to Oswythe at Lugazag\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/5)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/5)\tCollect materials to build a gate to seal off the entrance of Lugazag. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4099]="70065678\n1\tReturn to Haliggyr at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/5)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/5)\tCollect materials to build a gate to seal off the entrance of Tírith Rhaw. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4100]="70065677\n1\tDeliver the materials to Gozad at Tiríth Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood logs ([see journal]/10)\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/10)\tMake your way into the wilds of the Ettenmoors and collect the materials needed to construct the internal gate.\n",
[4101]="70065679\n1\tReturn to Kolr at Lugazag\030Collect Grimwood logs ([see journal]/10)\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/10)\tCollect materials to build a door that will defend the upper level of Lugazag. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4102]="70065675\n1\tReturn to Malhathel at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood logs ([see journal]/10)\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/10)\tCollect materials to build a gate to seal off the upper level of Tírith Rhaw. All the materials needed can be found in the wilds of the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4103]="7007082B\n1\tDeliver the materials to Dumûl at Lugazag\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/2)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/2)\tHead into the Ettenmoors and collect the materials that are needed to reinforce the gate at Lugazag.\n",
[4104]="70070829\n1\tDeliver the materials to Gaath at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/2)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/2)\tHead into the Ettenmoors and collect the materials that are needed to reinforce the gate at Tírith Rhaw.\n",
[4105]="7007082C\n1\tReturn to Oswythe at Lugazag\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/2)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/2)\tHelp to further reinforce the stronghold at Lugazag by collecting materials to reinforce the gate. You will find all you need throughout the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4106]="7007082A\n1\tReturn to Haliggyr at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Grimwood kindling\030Collect unrefined Isendeep ore ([see journal]/2)\030Collect Grimwood roots ([see journal]/2)\tHelp to further reinforce the stronghold at Tírith Rhaw by collecting materials to reinforce the gate. You will find all you need throughout the Ettenmoors.\n",
[4107]="70058FC8\n1\tRepair damaged barricades at Zarkul-sulûn (total: 8)\tDamaged barricades can be found throughout Zarkul-sulûn. Sigvith has asked you to repair barricades damaged in the siege of Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Sigvith\tSigvith can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You have repaired many of the damaged barricades at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report back to Sigvith.\n",
[4108]="70009EC3\n1\tDefeat the Free Peoples at Grothum (total: 6)\tSlaughter the Free Peoples as they attempt to destroy the goblins of Grothum. You have been asked to honour the pledge made by Angmar to assist the goblins against the Free Peoples, an obligation you must fulfil.\n2\tTalk to Gasham\030Talk to War-tyrant Akúlhun\tGrothum is defended and your obligation to the goblins is complete. Return to Gasham and tell him so. If Gasham was killed, return to the War-tyrant and tell him of your victory. Fighting off the enemy within the bounds of Grothum proved a simple task for one such as you.\n",
[4109]="70043DEF\n1\tDefend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge\tThe Belegiant Bridge is located in centre of Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should defend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge.\n2\tKeep your post and defend the centre of the bridge\tThe Belegiant Bridge is located in the centre of Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should keep your post and defend the centre of the Belegiant Bridge. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with Melethon\tMelethon is at the Causeway Forts. You should speak to Melethon.\n",
[4110]="70027106\n1\tDefeat the craban-spies (total: 4)\030Move the rocks to enlist the aid of the Old Tree\tBoulders can be found near the roots of the Tree. Guard Cai has asked you to move the boulders near the crebain so the Tree can help you defeat them.\n2\tTalk to Guard Cai at the eastern guardpost\tGuard Cai is at the eastern guardpost of the Pristine Glade. The craban-spies are redoubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Cai again and find out what can be done to stop them.\n",
[4111]="70043DEB\n1\tDefend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge\tThe Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should defend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge.\n2\tKeep your post and defend the centre of the bridge\tThe Ornendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should keep your post and defend the centre of the Ornendil Bridge. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with Edenos\tEdenos is at the Palace of Eldacar. You should speak to Edenos.\n",
[4112]="7006C52D\n1\tDestroy poison spreaders (total: 5)\030Defeat Orcs (total: 10)\tYour mission is to travel to the river near Maurûsh and stop the Orcs there from poisoning the tributary.\n",
[4113]="70027103\n1\tDefend the southern guardpost from half-orcs\tHalf-orcs are attacking the southern guardpost from the west. Guard Edrud has asked you to defend the southern guardpost with his guards.\n2\tTalk to Guard Edrud at the southern guardpost\tGuard Edrud is at the southern guardpost of the Pristine Glade. The half-orcs are redoubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Edrud again and find out what can be done to stop them.\n",
[4114]="70027108\n1\tDefend the western guardpost from the Uruk-hai\tGuard Ambras is at the western guardpost of the Pristine Glade. Guard Ambras has asked you to stop all the torch-bearers from reaching the Tree.\n2\tTalk to Guard Ambras at the western guardpost\tGuard Ambras is at the western guardpost of the Pristine Glade. The Uruk-hai are re-doubling their efforts. You should speak with Guard Ambras again and find out what can be done to stop them.\n",
[4115]="700413B8\n1\tFind and speak with Arvaethor\tArvaethor can be found near a pillaged lumber camp south-east of the village of Ethring. You should find and speak with Arvaethor.\n",
[4116]="70054882\n1\tYou are fated to labour in service to the Dark Lord.\t\n2\tDeliver a barrel of armour to the Uruk garrison-captain\030Deliver a barrel of spears to the Uruk garrison-captain\030Deliver a barrel of swords to the Uruk garrison-captain\tThe Uruk garrison-captain can be found in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\n",
[4117]="7002560B\n1\tLocate the first general of Sâri-surma\tDrugoth the Death-monger has relocated from the Misty Mountains and made his new home in the largest glacier in the Icebay of Forochel. Now, his mad, rambling mind is planning an attack on Annúminas to the south. You must stop this attack before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals.\n2\tDefeat the first general, Coldbear\tYou must stop the attack on Annúminas before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals. You have discovered the first general, Coldbear. The creature must be defeated if you are to ascend the path to Drugoth.\n3\tLocate the second general of Sâri-surma\tColdbear has been defeated, but the second general still awaits battle within the fortress. You will likely encounter the final general on your way to Drugoth.\n4\tDefeat the second general, Osan\tYou must stop the attack on Annúminas before it happens by killing Drugoth and both of his generals. You have discovered the second general, Osan. The giant and his minions will attempt to block your path, preventing you from confronting Drugoth.\n5\tDefeat Drugoth the Death-monger\tDrugoth the Death-monger has relocated from the Misty Mountains and made his new home in the largest glacier in the Icebay of Forochel. Now, his mad, rambling mind is planning an attack on Annúminas to the south. Drugoth has fled to the summit of Sâri-surma. Confront him, and put an end to his malicious plans.\n",
[4118]="70044305\n1\tDefend the north-west entrance of Crithost\tCrithost is located in Talath Anor. You should defend Crithost from the approaching scouting party at the north-west entrance.\n2\tStand your ground and defend Crithost\tCrithost is located in Talath Anor. You should defend the north-west entrance of Crithost. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tDefend the southern entrance of Crithost\tCrithost is located in Talath Anor. You should defend Crithost from the approaching scouting party at the south entrance.\n4\tStand your ground and defend Crithost\tCrithost is located in Talath Anor. You should defend the southern entrance of Crithost. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tTalk to Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[4119]="70072715\n1\tEarn Mûr Ghala commendations by completing World Quests (total: 20)\tThroughout the broken realm, your efforts kindle a flicker of hope. In recognition of such valour, you will receive honours and rewards worthy of your pursuits.\n2\tCompleted\tThroughout the broken realm, your efforts kindle a flicker of hope. In recognition of such valour, you are granted honours and rewards worthy of your pursuits.\n",
[4120]="70071B45\n1\tTBD Return to Quest Giver\tTBD Return to Quest Bestower\n",
[4121]="70027815\n1\tDestroy barricades around the watch-tower (total: 5)\tBarricades can be found surrounding the watch-tower in Trum Dreng. You should destroy the barricades and defeat the vigilant raiders who guard them.\n2\tReturn to Elain at the watch-tower\tElain guards the path leading up to the watch-tower. You should speak with Elain and tell her that the barricades have been destroyed, and the path to the tower is now clear.\n",
[4122]="70025ABB\n1\tDefeat scouts (total: 4)\tScouts can be found in the stands of trees south-west and south-east of the bluff overlooking the colossus. Cudhaer asked you to flush out several scouts while he repairs the catapult.\n2\tTalk to Cudhaer near the colossus\tCudhaer is at the bluff overlooking the colossus from the south. Cudhaer will be pleased to hear the scouts have been driven off and his position is secure.\n3\tTalk to Sardan\tSardan is at the Colossus, north of the catapult's bluff. Sardan will want to know the catapult is repaired and ready to fire.\n",
[4123]="7002F989\n1\tDefeat the Orc-tormenters (total: 2)\030Secure the farm gate\tRandgar's farm is south and east of Cliving, along the road. The gate is just outside the small home. Randgar has asked you to secure the gates to his farmstead, but to be wary of assaults from Orcs.\n2\tTalk to Randgar\tRandgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road. Randgar awaits outside his home for news that the constant Orc-menace has been put to an end.\n",
[4124]="700571BB\n1\tAssist Yrsa Spearwife with \"Spears of War\"\030Assist Trygvar with \"A Day Without Honey\"\030Assist Sighild with \"The Roaming Threat\"\030Assist Thyra with \"Saving the Beasts\"\tYrsa Spearwife, Thyra, Sighild, and Trygvar can all be found in Limlók. You should assist each of them with their tasks.\n2\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.\n",
[4125]="70001877\n1\tTalk to Gatson's farmhand Alwin\tGatson's man Alwin is with the herd, south of the farm. Gatson has asked you to help his farmhand, Alwin, defend his herd from the marauding Orcs. Make sure neither Alwin nor any of the herd come to harm.\n2\tTalk to Gatson\tGatson is at his farm, north of the fields where his herd grazes. You and Alwin managed to stave off the Orcs' raid on Gatson's herd. You should return to the farm and tell Gatson.\n",
[4126]="7005A654\n1\tTravel to Imrêkh-guthlu\tImrêkh-guthlu can be found in the southern reaches of Máttugard, near Deepscrave. You should travel to Imrêkh-guthlu.\n2\tTalk to Hetbrúda at Imrêkh-guthlu\tHetbrúda can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard. You should talk to Hetbrúda.\n3\tTalk to Lóssi\tLóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard. You should talk to Lóssi.\n4\tDefend the stair from attacking captains (total: 2)\030Defend the bridge from attacking defilers (total: 4)\tImrêkh-guthlu can be found in the southern reaches of Máttugard, near Deepscrave. You should defend Imrêkh-guthlu.\n5\tTalk to Hetbrúda at Imrêkh-guthlu\tHetbrúda can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard. You should talk to Hetbrúda.\n",
[4127]="7004429A\n1\tDefend the southern Rammas\tThe nearby crack in the Rammas is located in the south-western end of the Out-wall. You should defend the crack in the southern Rammas from the Harlond Orcs.\n2\tKeep your post and defend the southern Rammas\tThe nearby crack in the Rammas is located in the south-western end of the Out-wall. You should defend the crack in the southern Rammas from the Harlond Orcs. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tSpeak with Turgon\tTurgon can be found at the southern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Turgon.\n",
[4128]="7006B1D8\n1\tComplete Defending the Umbar-môkh quests (total: 20)\tDefending the Umbar-môkh quests are available from Bôgalekh and Zûfan in Jadambor, from bounty boards in Ilmabiri and Dil-irmíz, and from defeating spiders, bog-lurkers, and shades in Dil-irmíz to collect supplies required by Kavíra, the healer.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted many Defending the Umbar-môkh quests aiding in the defence of the Umbar-môkh.\n",
})
